('2026-06-03','run7-member-enrollment-2026-06-03','HEALTHY',38.0,'New Bronze source member_enrollment onboarded into PII-safe Silver (mask ssn/email/phone via mask_pii macro; drop raw name/dob) and a PII-free Gold aggregate at state x plan_type x risk_tier grain. Human APPROVED Gold; materialized 49 rows first-attempt. Reusable pattern: mask format-bearing identifiers, DROP free-text PII, aggregate Gold so no row-level id is exposed; in dbt YAML regex on Spark prefer [*]/[.] char classes over backslash escapes.','stg_member_enrollment, gold_member_risk_summary',23,0,0,0,0,1,50,99,'https://github.com/dflo8787/my-dbt-healthcare/pull/7', current_timestamp())

  
